Package: ttetmle
Title: Target Trial Emulation via Time-to-Event Targeted Minimum Loss-Based Estimation
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jacob", "Tiegs", email = "tiegsjacob@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implements Clone-Censor-Weighting (CCW) integrated with Survival
    Targeted Minimum Loss-Based Estimation (TMLE) for dynamic treatment regimes
    and immortal time bias resolution in observational time-to-event data.
    Provides stratified hazard estimation via SuperLearner, decoupled clever
    covariates, patient-level Empirical Influence Curve (EIC) variance, and
    simultaneous confidence bands via the multiplier bootstrap.
